Package: ffarfima
Type: Package
Title: Memory Estimation, Order Selection and Forecasting for Functional ARFIMA Models
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Chang", "Liu", email = "cliu9549@sydney.edu.au", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Thomas", "Kuenzer", role = c("ctb", "cph"), comment = "FARMA operator estimator"),
    person("Christian", "Leschinski", role = c("ctb", "cph"), comment = "local Whittle and LPWN code from LongMemoryTSA"),
    person("Diethelm", "Wuertz", role = c("ctb", "cph"), comment = "Peng (DFA) estimator from fArma")
    )
Description: Tools for long-memory functional time series modelled as functional
    ARFIMA (FARFIMA) processes. The memory parameter is estimated from the leading
    functional principal component score with detrended fluctuation analysis, local
    Whittle, local polynomial Whittle with noise (LPWN) or sieve-bootstrap
    bias-corrected LPWN. Short-memory orders are selected by an adaptive functional
    Hannan-Quinn criterion (exhaustive or automatic search), forecast-based
    cross-validation, or a functional Box-Jenkins procedure. Point forecasts are
    accompanied by scaled-residual, split-conformal and adaptive conformal
    prediction bands, with interval and weighted interval scores for evaluation.
